<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>EU-India Relationship Slideshow</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; background: #f4f4f4; }
    .slideshow-container {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      position: relative;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .slide {
      display: none;
      padding: 40px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .slide h2 {
      font-size: 28px;
      color: #002f6c;
    }
    .slide p {
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #333;
    }
    .active {
      display: block;
    }
    .nav-buttons {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 20px;
    }
    .nav-buttons button {
      padding: 10px 20px;
      margin: 5px;
      border: none;
      background-color: #002f6c;
      color: white;
      font-size: 16px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .nav-buttons button:hover {
      background-color: #004a99;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="slideshow-container">
    <div class="slide active">
      <h2>🌍 EU-India: A Strategic Partnership for the Future</h2>
      <p>Bridging two vibrant democracies through trade, technology, sustainability, and shared values.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="slide">
      <h2>📈 €120 Billion+ in Bilateral Trade</h2>
      <p>The EU is India’s second-largest trading partner. A balanced FTA can unlock billions in potential.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="slide">
      <h2>💡 Tech Synergies Driving the Digital Decade</h2>
      <p>AI, 5G, cybersecurity, green tech and DPI are reshaping future-ready economies.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="slide">
      <h2>🌱 Green Partnerships for a Greener Tomorrow</h2>
      <p>Shared goals in circular economy, clean energy, and climate finance are driving joint impact.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="slide">
      <h2>🎓 Knowledge Without Borders</h2>
      <p>From Erasmus+ to skill development, youth and academic exchange shape future collaboration.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="slide">
      <h2>💊 Joint Research, Stronger Health Systems</h2>
      <p>Vaccines, biopharma innovation, and preparedness have brought India and EU closer.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="slide">
      <h2>🏢 Small Businesses, Big Impact</h2>
      <p>EU-India corridor supports thousands of MSMEs through knowledge and market access.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="slide">
      <h2>🤝 Shared Values, Global Influence</h2>
      <p>Democracy, rule of law, and multilateralism form the bedrock of EU-India diplomacy.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="slide">
      <h2>🎭 A Rich Tapestry of Heritage</h2>
      <p>From cinema to cuisine – EU and India celebrate centuries of cultural exchange.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="slide">
      <h2>🚀 From Dialogue to Action</h2>
      <p>FTA, digital partnerships, and sustainability frameworks point to a transformative future.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="slide">
      <h2>📣 Be Part of the EU-India Story</h2>
      <p>Policymakers, entrepreneurs, academics – stay informed with Europe India Journal.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="nav-buttons">
    <button onclick="prevSlide()">Previous</button>
    <button onclick="nextSlide()">Next</button>
  </div>

  <script>
    let currentSlide = 0;
    const slides = document.querySelectorAll('.slide');

    function showSlide(index) {
      slides.forEach((slide, i) => {
        slide.classList.remove('active');
        if (i === index) slide.classList.add('active');
      });
    }

    function nextSlide() {
      currentSlide = (currentSlide + 1) % slides.length;
      showSlide(currentSlide);
    }

    function prevSlide() {
      currentSlide = (currentSlide - 1 + slides.length) % slides.length;
      showSlide(currentSlide);
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
